    "['mpls rsvp-te', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'unit [parameter2] family [parameter3] [parameter4] [parameter5]', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]'}]]": 2,
    "['mpls rsvp-te hello', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols rsvp hello interval 9', 'parent_command': ['set system host-name [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set system host-name [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent command for `mpls rsvp-te hello`:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols rsvp hello interval 9\\nset protocols rsvp interface all hello interval 9\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. In Juniper, RSVP hello is enabled by default, but the interval (default 9 seconds) needs to be explicitly configured if you want to change it from default.\\n2. The command is split into:\\n   - Global RSVP hello configuration\\n   - Interface-specific RSVP hello configuration (applied to all interfaces)\\n3. The interval value of 9 seconds matches Huawei's default hello interval.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols rsvp hello interval 9'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols rsvp interface all hello interval 9', 'parent_command': ['set system host-name [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set system host-name [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent command for `mpls rsvp-te hello`:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols rsvp hello interval 9\\nset protocols rsvp interface all hello interval 9\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. In Juniper, RSVP hello is enabled by default, but the interval (default 9 seconds) needs to be explicitly configured if you want to change it from default.\\n2. The command is split into:\\n   - Global RSVP hello configuration\\n   - Interface-specific RSVP hello configuration (applied to all interfaces)\\n3. The interval value of 9 seconds matches Huawei's default hello interval.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols rsvp interface all hello interval 9'}]]": 1,
