    "['explicit-path [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent for the `explicit-path` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.2.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5 strict\\n##\\n\\nThe `strict` keyword in Juniper is equivalent to Huawei's `next hop` in explicit paths, indicating that the listed hops must be traversed in sequence. The path name `tope2` is preserved for consistency.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.2.1.2 strict', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.2.1.2 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent for the `explicit-path` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.2.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5 strict\\n##\\n\\nThe `strict` keyword in Juniper is equivalent to Huawei's `next hop` in explicit paths, indicating that the listed hops must be traversed in sequence. The path name `tope2` is preserved for consistency.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.2.1.2 strict'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent for the `explicit-path` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.2.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5 strict\\n##\\n\\nThe `strict` keyword in Juniper is equivalent to Huawei's `next hop` in explicit paths, indicating that the listed hops must be traversed in sequence. The path name `tope2` is preserved for consistency.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5 strict', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent for the `explicit-path` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.2.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5 strict\\n##\\n\\nThe `strict` keyword in Juniper is equivalent to Huawei's `next hop` in explicit paths, indicating that the listed hops must be traversed in sequence. The path name `tope2` is preserved for consistency.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5 strict'}]]": 1,
    "['next hop [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict', 'parent_command': ['set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict'], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict\\n##', 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict'}]]": 1,
    "['next hop [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls explicit-path tope2 hop 10.2.1.2', 'parent_command': ['set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict'], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols mpls explicit-path tope2 hop 10.2.1.2\\n##', 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls explicit-path tope2 hop 10.2.1.2'}]]": 1,
    "['next hop [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict', 'parent_command': ['set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict'], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- In Juniper, explicit paths are defined under `protocols mpls path` hierarchy\\n- `tope2` is the path name (matches Huawei's explicit-path name)\\n- `10.4.1.2` is the next-hop address\\n- `strict` indicates this is a strict hop (equivalent to Huawei's `next hop` command)\\n- Juniper doesn't use separate `next hop` commands but lists all hops in sequence under the path definition\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.4.1.2 strict'}]]": 1,
    "['next hop [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5', 'parent_command': ['set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict'], 'root': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 10.1.1.2 strict', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent command for `next hop 5.5.5.5`:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5\\n##\\n\\nExplanation: In Juniper, explicit paths are configured under `protocols mpls path` with the destination addresses listed directly (rather than using `next hop` commands like Huawei). The path name (`tope2`) is preserved from the original configuration.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls path tope2 5.5.5.5'}]]": 1,
